  "body": "## Changelog\n* 3b3a0588b4915252c355011ad0cec46973ec41bc Bump fly-go to v0.11.2. (#5238)\n* 3ed1acbaae0c786d5210002ad77b642682e88b52 Stop creating dev tags. (#5243)\n* b517d0ea7606f798a02e3b587772177dac3c0668 Delete test tokens after use. (#5241)\n* 15291c2486f178c6bb9ff73e5fa661aa1b23c631 chore(deps): bump google.golang.org/grpc from 1.83.2 to 1.84.0 (#5235)\n* 2b305cccd7613d8980dc8c17ee3d6788ee960aed chore(deps): bump github.com/dustin/go-humanize from 1.0.1 to 1.1.0 (#5236)\n* fe73b7215a0ce2ed8e846d927446c1577cbcc217 add support for token-mode wireguard in flyctl agent (#5232)\n\n"
